ly gave the Fuggers control over Tyrol’s copper and silver mines. Of revenues from those mines, 50 percent would go to the Fuggers, 18 percent to Maximilian, and 32 percent to the mining contractor.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2049, 'temperature': 0.2})
